The '''Goblin Cave''', known to the [[goblin (race)|goblins]] as the '''Plain of Mud''', is a [[Dungeons|dungeon]] filled with [[goblin]]s located east of the [[Fishing Guild]] and south of [[Hemenster]]. Some of its inhabitants are [[aggressive]] no matter what level you are. 

The cave contains the entrance to the [[Goblin Temple]], built by goblin tribes for [[Bandos]] during the [[Fourth Age]] after the [[Battle of Plain of Mud]].

==Transportation==
The fastest methods to get to the Goblin Cave include:
*Using a [[plain of mud sphere]] to teleport directly inside the cave (requires Land of the Goblins)
*Using a [[skills necklace]] to teleport directly outside the Fishing Guild and running east.
*Using the [[Fishing cape]] to teleport directly to the guild, and running east.
*[[Ardougne Teleport|Teleporting to Ardougne]] and running north (requires Plague City)
*Using the [[Ardougne cloak]] 2/3/4, teleport to the farming patch north of Ardougne and head west.

==Quests==
*[[Dwarf Cannon]], when finding the missing dwarf child, [[Lollk]].
*[[One Small Favour]], as [[Slagilith]] is encountered here.
*[[Land of the Goblins]], as the entrance to the [[Goblin Temple]] is here.
*[[The General's Shadow]] [[miniquest]], in which players need to kill [[Bouncer (Ghost)|Bouncer]].

